      "id": "ALIGN-289",
      "contract": "Removing a non-selector recognized panel also resets the USB/HDD selected slot.",
      "evidence": "Emitter inherits empty original onCoverRemove; original selector alone resets. Native switch resets every PanelCover before its otherwise-correct panels.removed selector gate.",
